 padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%A2%E5%BC%A9%E7%AE%AD\" title=\"红弩箭\"><img alt=\"红弩箭\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%A2%E5%BC%A9%E7%AE%AD\" title=\"红弩箭\">红弩箭</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.4</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>银行</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>线与数之间</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：300403</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"5\">技能1</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">技能2</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">追击</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"5\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3004/300403/技能1.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3004/300403/技能1 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3004/300403/技能2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3004/300403/技能2 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3004/300403/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3004/300403/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3004/300403/追击.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3004/300403/追击 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3004/300403/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3004/300403/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">“剑术？！你在跟我开玩笑吗？”<br />它是一门技艺，是士兵在战场上至关重要的生存技能。<br /><br />“那跟我有什么关系，你觉得飞行女巫会在地面上跟敌人互殴？”<br />依靠神秘术驱动的道具总有不可靠的时候。万一扫帚无法起飞，你还是得靠自己的一双腿上战场。<br /><br />“你说得……哼，算你有点道理。那又为什么是剑术？”<br />这里是崇尚数学的小岛，能向人们传授与几何有关的真理——包括剑术在内。岛上甚至有一套可用于训练的铠甲，它与47/3似乎相当契合。<br /><br />“听起来还不坏嘛，正好有的是时间，我这就来过两招！”<br /><br />长剑的剑尖即原点，自其延伸为线，然后是面、角度……无穷组合。当“技术”升华为“艺术”，几何的技艺便借其主人之手熠熠生辉。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"300403\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-300404.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f6/Belonging-300404.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">科克长剑<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Koch\" the Sword</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />2000<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>兼具挥砍与突刺，是为了最理性的剑术而存在。组合直线、曲线与点，以此讨伐所有不规整。“切割，乃是解决几何题的基础手段。”剑术的开创者如是说。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-300405.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/4e/Belonging-300405.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">芒星缀饰品<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Hexagram Pendent</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />24<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>有着星星形状的腰间饰品，与圆和三角串联，是结课剑士的证明。几何的线条代表了在战斗技艺上的无限探索，有人说，这枚饰品能号令一小众军队。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-300406.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/87/Belonging-300406.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">金叶桂冠<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Golden Laurel Crown</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />15<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>由黄金和银打造的头冠，每片叶子都精雕细琢，向众人展示着她的胜利与荣耀。不过其上的棘刺与重量，也时刻提醒佩戴者，这荣光背后的付出。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%A0%E4%BD%95%E6%8A%80%E8%89%BA1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 几何技艺1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%A0%E4%BD%95%E6%8A%80%E8%89%BA1.jpg/229px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%A0%E4%BD%95%E6%8A%80%E8%89%BA1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"229\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%A0%E4%BD%95%E6%8A%80%E8%89%BA1.jpg/344px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%A0%E4%BD%95%E6%8A%80%E8%89%BA1.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%A0%E4%BD%95%E6%8A%80%E8%89%BA1.jpg/459px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%A0%E4%BD%95%E6%8A%80%E8%89%BA1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1530\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%A0%E4%BD%95%E6%8A%80%E8%89%BA2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 几何技艺2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%A0%E4%BD%95%E6%8A%80%E8%89%BA2.jpg/229px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%A0%E4%BD%95%E6%8A%80%E8%89%BA2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"229\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%A0%E4%BD%95%E6%8A%80%E8%89%BA2.jpg/344px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%A0%E4%BD%95%E6%8A%80%E8%89%BA2.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%A0%E4%BD%95%E6%8A%80%E8%89%BA2.jpg/459px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%87%A0%E4%BD%95%E6%8A%80%E8%89%BA2.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1530\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">几何技艺 <small style=\"color: grey\">The Art of Destreza</small></span></span>"}}